{
  "id": "1CH.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Mihayo Ya Shikū 4",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndūgū jingī ja mu lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Yuda baalī: Pelezi, Hezeloni, Kalīmi, Huuli, na Shobaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leaya ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Shobaali walī ise wa ba: Yahati, ū Yahati ūmyala Ahumayi na Lahadi. Ī jenī hū jalī ndūgū ja Bazoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba beena baalī bitūnja ba ng'wa Etamu: Yezileeli, Ishima, na Idibashi; ilūmbū lyabo witanagwa Hazeleliponi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Penueli walī ise wa ng'wa Gedooli, Ezeeli ise wa ng'wa Husha. A banhū benaba baalī ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Huuli, ūyo walī myalwa wa kwandya wa ng'wa Efulata, na ise wa ng'wa Betelehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ashuli ū ise wa ng'wa Tekoa walī na bake babīlī: Hela na Naala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Naala akamyalīla ba Ahuza, Hefa, Temeni na Hahashitaalī. A banhū benaba baalī ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Naala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abitūnja ba ng'wa Hela baalī: Zeleti, Zohali, Etinani ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Kozi, ūyo walī ise wa ba Hanubu na Hazobeba na wa banhū ba ndūgū ja kūfuma mulī Ahaheli, ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Halumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabezi walī akūjiwe kūtinda a baana ba ng'wawe; ū nina aho wamyala akang'wilīka ī lina lya Yabezi nguno akahaya gīkī, “Namyala mu makoye no.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yabezi ūnīlīīla ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli alīhaya, “Nalīlomba ūnīlūkīle mbango jako, ūninhe sī ngalī; nū nkono gwako gūbize hamò nane, ūnilang'hane natizūgwa mu makoye.” Ū Mulungu ūng'wigwa, ūng'wītīla gīt'ūmo kwalī kūlomba kwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kelubu ng'wana wa ng'wawe wa ng'wa Shuha, walī ise wa ng'wa Mehili; ū Mehili ūmyala Eshitoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eshitoni ūbabyala ba Beti-lafa, Pasea, na Tehina ūyo akamyala Ili-nahashi. A banhū benaba baalī bana Leka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Kenazi baalī: Osinieli na Selaya. A bitūnja ba ng'wa Osinieli baalī: Hatati na Meonotai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Meonotai ūmyala Ofula. Ū Selaya ūmyala Yoabu, ūyo walī nkūlgenji wa banhū ba sī ya Ge-halashimu. Ī sī yenīyo yiitanagwa lina lyenīlo nguno a bajiga-jiga bamo baalī baakoolī ba kūbeeja shikolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Kelebu ū ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Yefune baalī: Ilu, Ela, Namu. Ū ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Ela walī Kenazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Yehalele baalī: Zifu, Zifa, Tilia, Aseleli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Ezila baalī: Yeesa, Meledi, Efa, na Yaloni. Ūmò wa bake ba ng'wa Meledi akababyala ba: Miliamu, Shamai na Ishiba ise wa ng'wa Eshitemoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ū Nke wakwe ū wa kūfuma mu lūganda lwa banhū ba Yuda ūmyala Yeledi ise wa ng'wa Gedooli, Heba ise wa ng'wa Soko, na Yekutieli ise wa ng'wa Zanoa.) Ū Bisia ū nshīke wa ng'wa Falao ūyo walī watoolwa na Meledi h'ūyo akababyala a baana benaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba nke wa ng'wa Hodia, ūyo walī ilūmbūye lya ng'wa Nahamu, ūmò wabo walī ise wa ng'wa Keila muna Galimi, ūngī walī ise wa ng'wa Eshitemoa munhū wa Maaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Shimoni baalī: Amunoni, Lina, Beni-hanani, na Tiloni. A banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Ishi baalī: Zoheti, na Beni-zoheti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Shela ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Yuda baalī: Eeli ise wa ba Leka na Laada, ūyo akabiza ise wa ng'wa Malesha. Nī ndūgū ja banhū abo baalī bamani ba kūbeeja kitaani, abo bikalaga Beti-ashibea jikafuma mulī ng'wenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamò na Yokimu na banhū ba Kozeba, na Yoashi, na Salafu ūyo akabiza ntemi wa Moabu na Yashubi-lahemu. (Ī mihayo yenīyī īfumile mu shandīkwa sha kale.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benaba baalī babūmbi bikalaga Netai na Gedela, bikalaga kwenūko bakūntūmamīlaga ntemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bitūnja Ba Ng'wa Simioni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Simioni baalī: Nemueli, Yamini, Yalibu, Zela na Shauli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Shauli ūmyala Shalumu, nang'hwe ū ng'wenūyo ūmyala Mibusamu, ū ng'wenūyo nang'hwe ūmyala Mishima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Mishima baalī: Ng'witūnja wakwe Hamueli, nang'hwe ūmyala Zaku, nang'hwe ūmyala Shimei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Shimei akabyala bitūnja batandatū na bashīke batandatū, alīyo a baana ba ng'wawe batapandīkile baana bingī. Na lūūlū ū lūganda lwabo lūtagalīhile gīt'ūmo lwalī lwa ng'wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A boi bikalaga Beeli-sheba, Molada, Hazaali-shuali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biliha, Ezemu, Toladi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Betueli, Holima, Sikilagi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beti-makaboti, Hazaali, Susimu, Beti-bili, na Sha-alaimu. Ī yenīyī yalī mizengo yabo kūshisha ikanza lya būsugi wa ng'wa Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A magūngūli ayo gaalī gabapīndīlīgije gaalī Etamu, Aini, Limoni, Tokeni na Ashani: magūngūli atanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na magūngūli gangī gaalīho ayo gaalī gīīpīndīlīgije ī mizengo yenīyo kūshisha kū nzengo gwa Baala. A genaya gaalī mapandī gabo, ūmo bikalaga. Hama baalī na shitabo sha mina ga ng'anda jabo; baalī bandīkilwe mo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meshobabu, Yamuleki, Yosha ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Amazia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoeli, Yehu ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Yoshibia, ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Selaiya, ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Asieli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Elionai, Yakoba, Yeshohaya, Asaya, Adieli, Yesimieli, Benaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Ziza ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Shifi, ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Aloni, ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Yedaya ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Shimuli, ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Shemaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū abo bahelilwe benaba baalī batongeeji ū mu ndūgū jabo; ī kaaya jabo jikongeja kūkūla na kūkīlanīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhūbenaba bajaga bakūsaama-saamaga bakūkoobaga madīīmīlo ga mitugo jabo, nose būūkakandya kū sī ya Gedooli, kīya ya sī ya ntubīlo gwa kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbona sī nsoga ya madīīmīlo gawiza, hangī nīyo ngalī, hama nembeezu na mholo. Ī kwandya bikalaga mo banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benabo bakabadumīla a ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Hamu ū mu sī ījo bikalaga, pye na a Bameune; būbayagaja geete gīt'ūmo īlī ī mihayo kūshisha lelo īyī. Hanuma ya henaho hū bikala mo boi a ha ng'wanya gwabo, nguno walīmo būdīīmīlo bowiza bo mitugo jabo. A mina gabo ayo gaalī gahelilwe gakilonga mu shikū ja ng'wa Hezekia ntemi wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho bitūnja ba ng'wa Ishi ba Pelatia, Neali, Lefaia, na Uzieli būtongeela ibità lya banhū magana atanò kūfuma ū mu Basimeoni benabo būja kūdumīla sī ya Seili; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "būbabūlaga a Baamaleki abo baalī basaagīla, abo baalī bapūlūgūka; bikala boi ū mu sī yenīyo kūshisha nī lelo yenīyī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
